1
00:00:00,860 --> 00:00:04,060
This is the timeline of a
world that doesn't exist:

2
00:00:04,110 --> 00:00:08,640
we made it up for this video. Its
years are counted from the Reckoning,

3
00:00:08,690 --> 00:00:12,920
the night the old crown shattered,
and the ruler reads in those years.

4
00:00:12,970 --> 00:00:17,910
Four centuries of history, with the saga
itself packed into the last few years

5
00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:19,315
at the right.

6
00:00:20,755 --> 00:00:25,885
Zoom in, and the story opens up. Each
character has a colour and a shape:

7
00:00:25,935 --> 00:00:31,975
Ash's ember diamonds, Mirelle's blue
circles, the Hollow King's violet squares.

8
00:00:32,025 --> 00:00:36,725
Journeys and wars are bands. You
can see at once who was where,

9
00:00:36,775 --> 00:00:38,941
and when their paths cross.

10
00:00:40,381 --> 00:00:44,291
Pull one character out of
the rest. Separate by tags,

11
00:00:44,341 --> 00:00:48,551
choose Mirelle, and her whole thread
moves into a track of its own:

12
00:00:48,601 --> 00:00:52,651
born at sea, the voyage, the
chart of the Drowned Coast,

13
00:00:52,701 --> 00:00:57,891
the escape. It's the quickest way to check
that her story holds together on its

14
00:00:57,941 --> 00:00:58,624
own.

15
00:01:00,094 --> 00:01:05,144
Link a setup to its payoff. The prophecy
at Greyfen is linked to the shard Ash

16
00:01:05,194 --> 00:01:09,494
finds and to the crown he reforges,
so the arcs above the line show every

17
00:01:09,544 --> 00:01:14,741
promise the story makes, and opening one
takes you straight to where it's kept.

18
00:01:18,124 --> 00:01:23,174
Revising? Right-click the timeline
and choose Shift or scale times.

19
00:01:23,224 --> 00:01:27,134
Move everything tagged Mirelle
a year later in one step,

20
00:01:27,184 --> 00:01:31,034
and every moment and journey
in her thread moves together,

21
00:01:31,084 --> 00:01:35,914
while the rest of the canon stays
put. One Undo puts it back.

22
00:01:39,104 --> 00:01:44,724
Unpublished work stays yours. Keep your
world in files on your own computer with

23
00:01:44,774 --> 00:01:49,387
the desktop app, or on a server,
private until you choose to share it.
